    "「跟随系统」读取系统深浅色设置；更改立即生效。外观仅作用于设置窗口；悬停放大的液态玻璃始终跟随系统深浅色。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow System reads the system appearance; changes apply immediately. The appearance setting styles the settings window only — the hover overlay's glass always follows the system appearance."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「跟随系统」读取系统深浅色设置；更改立即生效。外观仅作用于设置窗口；悬停放大的液态玻璃始终跟随系统深浅色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
