    "开启后，红绿灯的点击与悬停放大由 Blinker 接管；关闭后恢复系统默认行为。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While on, Blinker handles traffic-light clicks and the hover overlay; turning it off restores system defaults."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，红绿灯的点击与悬停放大由 Blinker 接管；关闭后恢复系统默认行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，鼠标悬停到窗口红绿灯按钮上会临时放大，点击即执行对应动作。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, hovering a window's traffic lights enlarges them; clicking performs the mapped action."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，鼠标悬停到窗口红绿灯按钮上会临时放大，点击即执行对应动作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
